OL,3,ALib Dems and Reform UK in war of words
OL,4,Aover alleged shove
OL,5,
OL,6,FA war of words has broken out between
OL,7,FLib Dem MP Caroline Voaden and Reform
OL,8,FUK leader Nigel Farage over an alleged
OL,9,Fphysical altercation in the House of
OL,10,FCommons.
OL,12,FThe row was triggered when Farage,
OL,13,Fexplaining why he had not attended
OL,14,FWednesday's Budget, said he had been
OL,15,Finvolved in a "physical altercation"
OL,16,Fwith another MP at the State Opening of
OL,17,FParliament in May and had wanted to
OL,18,Favoid a similar incident.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
