OL,3,ALib Dems and Reform UK in war of words
OL,4,Aover alleged shove
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoaden revealed herself to be the MP
OL,7,FFarage had been referring to, writing
OL,8,Fon social media that she had been left
OL,9,F"shocked and bloody angry" by the
OL,10,Fconfrontation.
OL,12,FThe Lib Dems have claimed that Farage
OL,13,F"attempted to shove" their South Devon
OL,14,FMP but a Reform source accused the
OL,15,Fparty of "lying".
